In the .NET project at /tmp/sv-90f4da4d6fc3441baf5723474f158aaf/before/, I need to fix AOT compatibility warnings in generated serialization files. These files use `JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, X)` and `JsonSerializer.Deserialize&lt;T&gt;(string)` which trigger IL2026/IL3050 warnings.

The fix patterns are:

**For `JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, X)` where X has IJsonModel:**
Replace with the IJsonModel Write method. Example:
```csharp
// Before:
JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, Error);
// After:  
JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, Error); // Keep as-is for ResponseError since it has no IJsonModel

// Before:
JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, Plan);
// After:
writer.WriteObjectValue(Plan, options);

// Before:  
JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, Identity);  // or ManagedIdentity
// After:
writer.WriteObjectValue(Identity, options);  // or ManagedIdentity

// Before:
JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, ExtendedLocation);
// After:
writer.WriteObjectValue(ExtendedLocation, options);

// Before:
JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, Parent);
// After:
writer.WriteObjectValue(Parent, options);
```

**For `JsonSerializer.Deserialize&lt;T&gt;(property.Value.GetRawText())` where T has a Deserialize method:**
Replace with the static Deserialize method. Example:
```csharp
// Before:
systemData = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<SystemData>(property.Value.GetRawText());
// After:
systemData = SystemData.DeserializeSystemData(property.Value);

// Before:
plan = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<ArmPlan>(property.Value.GetRawText());
// After:
plan = ArmPlan.DeserializeArmPlan(property.Value);

// Before:
identity = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<ManagedServiceIdentity>(property.Value.GetRawText());
// After:
identity = ManagedServiceIdentity.DeserializeManagedServiceIdentity(property.Value);

// Before:
extendedLocation = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<ExtendedLocation>(property.Value.GetRawText());
// After:
extendedLocation = ExtendedLocation.DeserializeExtendedLocation(property.Value);

// Before:
parent = JsonSerializer.Deserialize<SubResource>(property0.Value.GetRawText());
// After:
parent = SubResource.DeserializeSubResource(property0.Value);

// Before:
array.Add(JsonSerializer.Deserialize<OperationStatusResult>(item.GetRawText()));
// After:
array.Add(OperationStatusResult.DeserializeOperationStatusResult(item));
```

**For ResponseError (from Azure.Core - no IJsonModel available), suppress the warnings:**
```csharp
#pragma warning disable IL2026
#pragma warning disable IL3050
JsonSerializer.Serialize(writer, Error);  // or Deserialize
#pragma warning restore IL3050
#pragma warning restore IL2026
```

